    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore the origins of the mysterious Banban\u2019s Kindergarten. Survive the dark past of the establishment. Try to make some friends. Uncover the truth behind the place, and who you are\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/9f03468431c53404cd74f190da1dc905.poster.avif?t=1750914496\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/9f03468431c53404cd74f190da1dc905.webm?t=1750914496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/9f03468431c53404cd74f190da1dc905.mp4?t=1750914496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the dark past of the kindergarten...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the past of the kindergarten and explore the origins of the establishment. Only you can connect the dots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/fc18ddeb873f404d224ca98d10440623.poster.avif?t=1750914496\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/fc18ddeb873f404d224ca98d10440623.webm?t=1750914496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/fc18ddeb873f404d224ca98d10440623.mp4?t=1750914496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Opportunity to make friends\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your new home! Get out of your cell and meet your fellow neighbors. <span class=\"bb_strike\"><i>Everything</i></span> Everyone here is loving and wants to be your friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/bb3f9eda8dff5c5e9b3ea418b21d2b31.poster.avif?t=1750914496\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/bb3f9eda8dff5c5e9b3ea418b21d2b31.webm?t=1750914496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/bb3f9eda8dff5c5e9b3ea418b21d2b31.mp4?t=1750914496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/80a7e2613f00a319179a8c7d0791e654.poster.avif?t=1750914496\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/80a7e2613f00a319179a8c7d0791e654.webm?t=1750914496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300410/extras/80a7e2613f00a319179a8c7d0791e654.mp4?t=1750914496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
